# Build context for every root-context image (src/*/Dockerfile, context = repo root).
# Only Directory.*.props, global.json, src/ and the gateway FAR/catalog are actually needed.

# Build output and dependencies
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/TestResults
**/.vs
**/.idea
**/*.user
**/.DS_Store

# The Angular UI builds with its own context (./ui); P5 owns ui/.dockerignore.
ui

# Not part of any image
.git
.github
.claude
.codegraph
.superpowers
spike
tests
docs
phases
*.md
architecture.svg

# Dev-only values are passed as compose environment, never baked into an image
.env
.env.*
